# metallica_spike 1.03 - worked out by the app from the ports of The Beatles 1.29, Deadpool LE 1.14, Deadpool Pro 1.16, Godzilla Premium/LE 1.16, Godzilla Pro 1.15, Jaws LE 1.02, TMNT Pro 1.59.
# Emulator-proven 2026-09-24 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, item 162): the
# runtime hooked the game, 35 of its 40 shots came from their switches, a drain ended each ball, and
# the 7 events below fired where their names say (a tilted ball, three balls to the game's end).
# Shots no press made (their switch is left out of the check, or needs two): Left outlane, Right outlane, Coffin lock 1, Coffin lock 2, Coffin lock 3.
# program sha1 f5d1b36550b44555ff7467ab7ac38e67ab0c874d, portgen revision 3, 7 reference port(s) of framework generation B.

game           metallica_spike
version        1.03

